-----------------------------------------------------------
 Aggregate
   ->  Append
         ->  Merge Join
               Merge Cond: (b.x = a.id)
               ->  Sort
                     Sort Key: b.x
                     ->  Seq Scan on orexp_b b
               ->  Sort
                     Sort Key: a.id
                     ->  Seq Scan on orexp_a a
         ->  Merge Join
               Merge Cond: (b_1.y = a_1.id)
               Join Filter: ((a_1.id = b_1.x) IS NOT TRUE)
               ->  Sort
                     Sort Key: b_1.y
                     ->  Seq Scan on orexp_b b_1
               ->  Sort
                     Sort Key: a_1.id
                     ->  Seq Scan on orexp_a a_1
(19 rows)

